{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"bc2562d30d451271a81c0fff006640b8d217a26dc84d0bad079dff5fbc8e8456","occurred_at":"2026-11-22T05:11:16Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[2895,2896]],"mapped_path":"apps/crq-python/ops/vm-unit-switch-guest.py","quoted_text":"        elif args.phase in (\"drain-alive\", \"drain-ambiguous\"):\n            payload = drain_refuse_phase(args)","reason":"The two drain phases are dispatched to the same handler while --seed is independently selectable, and main performs no phase/seed binding or rejection. Thus `drain-alive --seed ambiguous` can reach the ambiguous seed path and be recorded under the alive phase’s evidence, mislabeling the proof evidence. Rejecting a conflicting seed or deriving it from the phase is a small correctness fix.","target":"9e8c1e097f83ee92968d65559812b06a0048b8d1"},"finding_id":"a1b2d2515e52ee94030a57f788ff72f49b7c876ee14447f78c509984d9135b83","previous_event_id":"e71b183e54d69d36c4139e8b82bcd2dc5d2db427a51a8276e1c82ef1ba914afd","review_id":"f1b5131645f96822be0f07c1707f2cbcab3333693f6cab11de508eb6e932b92d"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:a1b2d2515e52ee94030a57f788ff72f49b7c876ee14447f78c509984d9135b83:22d4d7455c53139fcc9a4646d5707ad6172501596a2fb094bc4cbf4448da0454"}